      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "B\u1EA1n b\u1ECB \u0111\u1EAFm t\xE0u v\xE0 m\u1EAFc k\u1EB9t tr\xEAn
        m\u1ED9t h\xF2n \u0111\u1EA3o hoang. M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n l\xE0
        sinh t\u1ED3n. H\xE3y t\xECm c\xF4ng c\u1EE5, h\u1EA1t gi\u1ED1ng v\xE0 quan
        tr\u1ECDng nh\u1EA5t l\xE0 th\u1EE9c \u0103n. Ch\u1EB7t c\xE2y \u0111\u1EC3
        nh\xF3m l\u1EEDa tr\u1EA1i, ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa s\u1EBD mang l\u1EA1i h\u01A1i
        \u1EA5m gi\xFAp b\u1EA1n s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t qua \u0111\xEAm. Tr\u1ED3ng tr\u1ECDt
        \u0111\u1EC3 c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 th\u1EE9c \u0103n m\xE0 \u0103n \u2013 b\u1EA1n
        kh\xF4ng mu\u1ED1n b\u1ECB ch\u1EBFt \u0111\xF3i. V\xE0 ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\xF3
        m\u1ED9t v\xE0i l\u1EDDi khuy\xEAn d\xE0nh cho b\u1EA1n:"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
